2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Ärvde Edhults Säteri efter fadern, ägde också Kianäs, Prästtorp,KUlla Sutarp samt Fagerhult i Kråkhults socken m. flera gårdar.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT VI. Captain Karl Johan of the Kalmar regiment, proprietor of Edshult, etc., m. Louisa Buren, and d. in 1875, issue six:—
2 CONT * Lieut. Karl Henrick Magnus of the Kalmar regiment, d. unmarried in 1865, and was buried in the family vault in Edshult churchyard ;
2 CONT * Axel Ivar, joined the Danes in 1864 and fought at Dyboll, served with the Italians 1869-72 and took part in the  storming of Rome, in 1892 became a lieut.-col. in the Swedish army, and in 1895 retired into the Reserve ; Pontus E
2 CONC dward, surgeon, d. unmarried 1884 ; 
2 CONT * Hugo Emil ;
2 CONT * Hedwig, m. Baron Emil Viktor Fleetwood, and d. in 1887, leaving issue ; and
2 CONT *  Louisa, m. Karl Pontus, proprietor of Boxholm.
2 CONT
2 CONT pg. 344-345
2 CONT
