1 NAME Olaus Petri /Öhrlin/
2 GIVN Olaus Petri
2 SURN Öhrlin
2 _MARNM Öhrlin
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE SEP 1707
2 ADDR
3 CITY Örsjö
3 STAE Kalmar County
3 CTRY Sweden
