1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Birth:	July 30 1813 - Vimmerby, Kalmar, Sweden
2 CONT Death:	Apr 11 1891 - Jönköping, Jönköping, Sweden
2 CONT Parents:	Christian Svalander, Anna Maria Svalander (born Aurell)
2 CONT Siblings:	Samuel Anders Svalander, Anna Christina Maria Svalander, Carolina Amalia Lindal (born Svalander), Kristian August Svalander, Eleonora Sophia Defiedirna Petersson (born Svalander), Carl Edvvard Otto Svalander
