2 CONT The [http://www.buildingsofireland.ie/niah/search.jsp?type=record&county=OF&regno=14946008 Borrisnafarney Parish Church] in the [http://www.buildingsofireland.ie/niah/search.jsp?type=record&county=OF&regno=14946011 Bloomfield Maus
2 CONC oleum], located 1.5 miles from the village of Moneygall beside the Loughton Estate in County Offaly, Ireland.
2 CONT
