2 DATE 2 JUN 1917
2 PLAC Växjö, Kronobergs län, Sverige
2 ADDR
1 OCCU Friherrinna
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT “The portrait you encountered at Teleborgs slott in Växjö depicts Anna Koskull, the wife of Count Fredrik Bonde. Teleborg Castle was constructed by Fredrik Bonde as a wedding gift for Anna, completed in 1900. This grand gesture wa
2 CONC s emblematic of their marriage, and the castle itself is a symbol of their union. After Fredrik's death, Anna continued to live in the castle until her own passing in 1917”
