0 @N6000000002577119534@ NOTE !SOURCE:
1 CONT 1- 16 Aug 1993: Data is from the records of Owen B Anderson.
1 CONT 2- Notes on this record says that the data came from Swedish Histories C;
1 CONT p 171. These are presumably found in the Family History Library in SLC,       Ut.
1 CONT 3- Research from Elle Heckscher, Uppsulla, Sweden. Svenska Adelus Attantavlor. (Swedish nobility pedigree records)
1 CONT 4- Swedish Postal Address Book; Stake Family History Center.
