0 @N6000000002577063241@ NOTE !NOTES:
1 CONT 1- 18 Aug 1993: Data is from the records of Owen B Anderson.
1 CONT 2- I have found out that the name SMALAND is the name of a privince
1 CONT in the center portion of Sweden which comprises the counties of Kalmar,
1 CONT Jonkoping, and Kronoberg. The use of this name alone does not point to a parish
1 CONT or county and the first place name is generaly a farm or village within the
1 CONT parish.
1 CONT 3-A note has the name of Ambrosia Westring. It mioght refere to the name of
1 CONT Hakan's first wife.
